== Walkthrough ==

''[[Sragg Bloodheart]] is located at 415, -310 in the Shrine of Bertoxxulous Guild Hall.''

You say, 'Hail, Sragg Bloodheart'

: Sragg Bloodheart says nothing.

'''Hand [[Sragg Bloodheart]] your [[Stained Cloth Note]]'''

:: ''Stained Cloth Note reads:''

:: <code>The tide shall turn, as will the light. Your talents could reward you greatly. Follow the shadows down, deep into the darkness. The filth and bile that flows silently underneath Qeynos shall become this city's deadliest enemy. Secretly enter the underworld from below the Grounds of Fate. The passage lies behind the bones, but watch your step, and your back. It is also in your best interest, if you value what little life you have, to be sure you are not followed. Sragg calls for you now.</code>

: Sragg Bloodheart says, 'Ah, another would-be soldier for the army of the Plaguebringer. Begone!"

